The real-PLC (Family0) seed and key derivation in `src/legacy/family0/` (`curve.rs`,
`present.rs`, `seed.rs`) follow gijzelaerr/s7commplus
(https://github.com/gijzelaerr/s7commplus, `s7commplus/v1_session_key/real_plc/`), which
identified HarpoS7's Family0 transforms as an x-only ECDH and a PRESENT-80 variant. That work
is used under the MIT License; the original notice is reproduced below, as required.

